# #vi-sysdiag-grid at scale — the real 21-card architecture (see .werk/diagram.mmd for the
# source Mermaid this was translated from), not the 4-card mv/cp/st/lv prototype.
#
# Two known losses in the translation, both worth recording on #vi-sysdiag-grid-gaps:
#   - Mermaid's three dotted edges (child->gate, gate->approvebar, log->tracker) become solid
#     here. The grid pipeline has no dashed-stroke option yet.
#   - `dev -->|reloads the server| proc` targeted a SUBGRAPH, not a card. A grid edge must
#     touch a card (R3), so it is retargeted to `runner` here.
#
# Variant, per #vi-sysdiag-grid-singlecell-scale: every card here spanned 2 rows in
# diagram-grid-full.wgrid, purely because the row was duplicated, not because either row did
# distinct work. Each of the 6 two-row bands (rows 1-2, 6-7, 11-12, 16-17, 21-22, 26-27 in the
# original) is merged into 1 row here — same column width per card, so a card that legitimately
# needs several edges on one face (state, live, runner) still gets the columns that requires.
# Built by union-merging each pair of rows cell-by-cell, then deleting the second row — 0
# conflicts found, meaning the two rows really were pure duplicates everywhere. The result
# renders within a few pixels of diagram-grid-full.svg: those second rows were never doing any
# layout work, only recording the card's height twice.

content
  flowchart TD
    subgraph mapview [MAP VIEW]
      tree["refines tree | the decision tree, as a list you open and close"]
      graph3d["3d graph | the same cards, drawn as a 3D web of links"]
      detail["card detail | the full text of one card"]
      rollup["rollup bar | counts of decided, open, and stale cards"]
    end
    subgraph pane [CHAT PANE]
      approvebar["approval bar | asks you to allow or deny a risky action"]
      composer["composer | the box where you type"]
      transcript["transcript | the chat history"]
      tabs["tab strip | one tab per chat"]
      header["model + context header | which model runs, and how much context is left"]
    end
    subgraph proc [SERVER PROCESS]
      state["state | GET /api/graph, one fetch of today's folded map"]
      live["live + sse | POST /api/chat, /api/ask, and the SSE stream back"]
      foldfn["fold | turns the log of past decisions into today's state"]
      runner["agent runner | runs the agent that answers you"]
      gate["permission gate | decides if a tool call may run"]
      lock["one-server lock | stops two servers running at once"]
      dev["dev reload | reloads code changes without losing a live chat"]
    end
    subgraph store [STORE]
      log["log.jsonl | every decision, ever made, in order"]
      chatlog["chat.jsonl | the saved chat messages"]
      allow["allow.json | tool calls you already said yes to"]
    end
    cli["cli | the commands that read and write the map"]
    child["claude code child | the Claude Code process doing the work"]
    tracker["issue tracker | an outside tool, like Linear or GitHub"]

    tree -->|loads the card tree| state
    graph3d -->|loads nodes and edges| state
    detail -->|loads one card's full text| state
    rollup -->|loads decided, open, and stale counts| state
    approvebar -->|asks before a risky action runs| live
    composer -->|sends what you type| live
    transcript -->|streams the reply as it is written| live
    tabs -->|switches which chat is live| live
    header -->|shows the model and context left| live
    state -->|asks for today's state| foldfn
    foldfn -->|reads every past decision| log
    live -->|starts the agent for a message| runner
    runner -->|runs the agent| child
    runner -->|saves the conversation| chatlog
    runner -->|checks no other server is running| lock
    child -->|checks before a tool runs| gate
    gate -->|checks the saved yes/no list| allow
    gate -->|asks you when unsure| approvebar
    child -->|changes the map| cli
    cli -->|appends the change| log
    log -->|copies a decision out| tracker
    dev -->|reloads the server on a code change| runner

    class tree,graph3d,detail,rollup,approvebar,composer,transcript,tabs,header read
    class state,live,foldfn,runner,gate,lock state
    class dev dev
    class log,chatlog,allow write
    class cli,child agent
    class tracker ext

